<!--
  X2CashShopCore - native static lib half of X2CashShopTool.
  See CASH_SHOP_TOOL_PLAN.md, "Decisions taken" and section 6 (the /clr trap).

  CLRSupport is deliberately ABSENT from every PropertyGroup below - not set
  to "false". That is what keeps this project outside the condition at
  Microsoft.CppBuild.targets:733 ('$(CLRSupport)' != 'false' and
  '$(CLRSupport)' != ''), which otherwise stamps /clr:nostdlib onto every
  ClCompile item with no CompileAsManaged guard. Do not add CLRSupport here
  for any reason - see the plan before touching this file.

  Two configs, Release and Debug, differing ONLY in Optimization and
  DebugInformationFormat. Both define NDEBUG and both use MultiThreadedDLL -
  do NOT give either config the normal debug CRT (MultiThreadedDebugDLL) or
  _DEBUG: luaLib.lib is release-STL (/DEFAULTLIB:msvcprt) and VS2010's
  _ITERATOR_DEBUG_LEVEL detect_mismatch pragma turns that into LNK2038 the
  moment anything here includes a Lua header. See plan section 7.
-->
